    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559040/extras/e45c59e1c8103d6a310b56dc73108336.avif?t=1741411661\" width=616 height=258 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You're just a kid.</i> Mom is sick. Dad is missing. It's up to you to overcome the sinister magic that poisons your world and bring your family back together.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559040/extras/eed677b80df60507a8bdd3f64eeb80b7.avif?t=1741411661\" width=616 height=258 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve intricate puzzles and evade  obstacles with precise, skillful platforming. Collect  musical instruments that change your environment with ancient magic, and gain skills and items that enhance your ability to move through that environment, unlocking new areas and leading you to your ultimate goal.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559040/extras/9002e09a4e6d1ee8b8b5ca69e8ae96e3.avif?t=1741411661\" width=616 height=258 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>But be careful,</i>\u00a0the hidden evil that threatens your life has sent dark spirits and terrible gatekeepers to hinder your efforts. These beings cannot be fought, <i>so</i>\u00a0<i>you will have to be smart!</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559040/extras/e45c59e1c8103d6a310b56dc73108336.avif?t=1741411661\" width=616 height=258 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You're just a kid.</i> Mom is sick. Dad is missing. It's up to you to overcome the sinister magic that poisons your world and bring your family back together.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559040/extras/eed677b80df60507a8bdd3f64eeb80b7.avif?t=1741411661\" width=616 height=258 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve intricate puzzles and evade  obstacles with precise, skillful platforming. Collect  musical instruments that change your environment with ancient magic, and gain skills and items that enhance your ability to move through that environment, unlocking new areas and leading you to your ultimate goal.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559040/extras/9002e09a4e6d1ee8b8b5ca69e8ae96e3.avif?t=1741411661\" width=616 height=258 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>But be careful,</i>\u00a0the hidden evil that threatens your life has sent dark spirits and terrible gatekeepers to hinder your efforts. These beings cannot be fought, <i>so</i>\u00a0<i>you will have to be smart!</i></p>",
    "short_description": "Solve intricate puzzles and evade obstacles with precise, skillful platforming. Collect musical instruments that change your environment with ancient magic, and gain skills and items that enhance your ability to move through that environment. Succeed, and you may just save your family.",
